    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "11 Ard na Greine is a generous and bright four-bedroom modern family home, ideally located on the edge of Bantry town. The property provides well-proportioned accommodation throughout and has been upgraded and improved by the current owners to a high standard.\r\nA notable feature of the property is the enclosed decking and outdoor entertaining area, which provides an attractive extension to the living accommodation and a private space for outdoor dining and relaxation. The property also benefits from off-street parking.\r\nThe location is particularly convenient, with Bantry Hospital, local schools, shops and a wide range of town amenities all within easy reach.\r\nThe current owners have undertaken a number of upgrades and modifications to the property, enhancing both its overall presentation and functionality, resulting in an impressive modern family home.\r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\nSolid Oak flooring \r\nPVC windows and doors \r\nLarge composite deck \r\nPrivate rear garden with side access\r\nMature planting to the front with seating area.\r\nCobblestone parking area for 2 cars  \r\nSpacious attic offers potential subject to planning permission. \r\nOil fired central heating \r\nHouse alarm \r\n\r\nProperty layout:\r\nEntrance hall: (1.76m x 4.8m)\r\nLiving room: (3.2m x 4m) \r\nOffice: (2.5m x 2.2m) \r\nGuest WC: (1.5m x 1.6m) wc & whb \r\nKitchen / dining: (6.2m x 3m) \r\nUtility: (1.5m x 3.1m) \r\nConservatory: (2.5m x 4.3m) \r\n\r\n1st floor: \r\nBedroom 1: (3m x 3m) built in wardrobes \r\nBedroom 2: (2.4m x 3m) built in wardrobes \r\nBedroom 3: (2.4m x 2m) \r\nBedroom 4: (3.2m x 3.3m) \r\nBathroom: (1.8m x 2.4m) bath, wc, whb \r\n\r\nAttic space: (7.5m x 4.3m)"
      },
